guarantee: gh failure: the run of the sha without createdAt (missing or null) -> exit 5, no wait (swallow at origin)
file: scripts/tw-wip-run
added_by: test-writer
test: bash scripts/ci/tw-wip-run.test.sh
--- old
    if not isinstance(created, str):
        sys.exit(5)
--- new
    if not isinstance(created, str):
        created = datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).strftime("%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ")
--- end
